:{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"Luxurious lambswool","settings":{"main_heading":"Luxurious lambswool throw blankets ","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p>As a family farm we are proud to provide the luxurious warmth of natural wool products to homes all over New Zealand and around the world. <\/p><p>Our throws are light and warm, ideal for a cosy winter night on the sofa, or a cooler summer evening in the garden. <\/p><p>We have a range of colours and designs to suit any home, bringing nature’s own style and comfort. Popular as a gift, we can provide our throws in a beautiful gift box to make the occasion even more special. <\/p>","button_text":"Browse Wool Products","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CopyofPR-Brm_c_0010_1_9e274a24-6713-476f-94e5-6edebee88614.jpg","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"auto","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":0,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"right","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":25,"padding-block-end-mobile":25}},"image_with_text_boxed_fq3gGf":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"   Baby blankets","settings":{"main_heading":" Baby blankets","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p>To keep our littlest kiwis warm and healthy, our lightweight lambswool baby blankets are perfectly sized for the cot or buggy.   <\/p><p>A timeless yet practical gift, destined to be a keepsake handed down through generations.  <\/p><p>Our baby blankets come in a beautiful gift box. <\/p>","button_text":"Shop Warm Baby Blankets","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/baby-gifts-collection","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3282.jpg","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"auto","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":0,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"left","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":25,"padding-block-end-mobile":25}},"image_with_text_boxed_LJ4LNG":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"Pure New Zealand","settings":{"main_heading":"Pure New Zealand Lambswool Yarn","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p>We are excited to share our very own Palliser Ridge Lambswool yarn. In the double knit (8 ply) it is perfect for handknitting, machine knitting, crocheting and any other creative projects.  <\/p><p>Our knitting yarns are sought after by creators of beautiful natural wool garments and homewares around New Zealand, including kiwi classics like beanies and warm winter jumpers. <\/p><p>Our Lambswool yarn comes in a range of colours, named for the members of our knitting group that meets each month in the wool shed (weather permitting!) to create their wonderful wool garments and other projects. <\/p><p>We love a good yarn! If you are interested in being part of our wool community, find out more <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here<\/span>. <\/p>","button_text":"Buy Lambswool Yarn","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/luxury-lambs-wool-blanket-large-twill-check","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Palliser_Ridge_Martinborough_Fair.png","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"auto","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":400,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"right","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":50,"padding-block-end-mobile":50}},"image_with_text_boxed_8YJjqi":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"Farming regeneratively","settings":{"main_heading":"Farming regeneratively","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p>In November 2021, Palliser Ridge became<a href=\"https:\/\/www.landtomarket.com\/\" target=\"_blank\"> Land to Market<\/a> verified, an accreditation developed by the <a href=\"https:\/\/savory.global\/\" target=\"_blank\">Savoury Institute<\/a>.<br\/><br\/>For the past 20 years Palliser Ridge has been embracing a New Zealand regenerative approach to farming thanks to the farm owners Jim & Marilyn Law’s Vision. <br\/><br\/><a href=\"https:\/\/ata.land\/palliser-ridge\/\" target=\"_blank\">Ata Land<\/a> continues to help Palliser Ridge by measuring, analysing and providing tools to keep improving the farm by using the Ecological Outcome Verification programme, proving scientifically that they are making positive impacts on the local ecosystem.<\/p>","button_text":"Buy Lambswool Yarn","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/palliser-ridge-luxury-blanket-large-twill-check","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/farm.jpg","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"auto","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":400,"image_max_height":460,"column_position":"left","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":25,"padding-block-end-mobile":25}},"section_6YXWcy":{"type":"section","blocks":{"group_aJAwnW":{"type":"group","name":"t:names.group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":0,"width":"custom","custom_width":50,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fill","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":true,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-